      "id": "masa_10.mjo::002519",
      "unit": "masa_10.mjo::u0188",
      "source": "　うぅ、はぁはぁ…ひ、ひっく」",
      "target": "　으으, 하아하아… 히, 힉.」",
      "source_sha256": "fdd586544ea50e6969d9e01d4574a0f8ba384a4d255bd9c58eec3784f1544a7e",
